  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the UK Digital Construction International Programme (DCIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK Digital Construction International Programme (DCIP) is hosted by Connected Places Catapult (CPC) an innovation accelerator funded by the UK Gov Department for Business and Trade (DBT). CPC will deliver technical assistance to the Government of Ukraine to implement Building Information Modelling (BIM) as an information management process which reduces risk and enables better outcomes for infrastructure delivery and reconstruction programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
